  {
   "id": "a121",
   "kind": "attr:alt",
   "en": "Coach David Ciboch, M.Ed. Sport Science, performing a barbell squat"
  },
  {
   "id": "h122",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"cb-dot\"></span><span><b>Coach David Ciboch</b><span>M.Ed. Sport Science · National-Team S&amp;C</span></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h123",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Who built this"
  },
  {
   "id": "h124",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Coached at the <em>national-team level.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h125",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "DEVELOP isn't a template from the internet. Every session was periodized by <strong style=\"color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;\">Coach David Ciboch</strong> — a decade of coaching from youth development to the UAE National Ice Hockey Team, applied to the exact age window your athlete is in right now."
  },
  {
   "id": "h126",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Master's Degree (M.Ed.) — PE &amp; Sport Science"
  },
  {
   "id": "h127",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Certified Strength &amp; Conditioning Coach"
  },
  {
   "id": "h128",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Former National Team Coach — UAE Ice Hockey"
  },
  {
   "id": "h129",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "1,000+ athletes developed across 30+ countries"
  },
  {
   "id": "h130",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "02 — What's Inside"
  },
  {
   "id": "h131",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Everything your young player <em>needs.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h132",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A complete, coach-built block of off-ice training — written for a 12–14-year-old body in the growth years, not borrowed from an adult plan."
  },
  {
   "id": "h133",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "24 Coach-Built Sessions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h134",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Three sessions a week for eight weeks, each about 45–55 minutes. Every session follows the same five-part shape — just run them in order."
  },
  {
   "id": "h135",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Video for Every Exercise"
  },
  {
   "id": "h136",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No guessing what a move looks like. Every single exercise links to a clean demo video your child can copy in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "h137",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "6 Skill-Check Tests"
  },
  {
   "id": "h138",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Six simple, measurable tests — a real number to beat at Week 1, 4 and 8. Progress you can actually see, not just hope for."
  },
  {
   "id": "h139",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easier &amp; Harder Scaling"
  },
  {
   "id": "h140",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Every move comes with a simpler version and a harder version — so it fits whether your child is brand-new or already athletic."
  },
  {
   "id": "h141",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The RAMP Warm-Up"
  },
  {
   "id": "h142",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A built-in 8–10 minute warm-up before every session — Raise, Activate, Mobilize, Prime — that grooves good movement and prevents injury."
  },
  {
   "id": "h143",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full Glossary &amp; Notes"
  },
  {
   "id": "h144",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Plain-English coaching notes and a complete glossary, so parents can run every session with confidence — no S&amp;C background needed."
  },
  {
   "id": "h145",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "03 — The Plan"
  },
  {
   "id": "h146",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The 8-week <em>journey.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h147",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Two four-week blocks that build in the right order — movement and strength first, then speed, power, and competition."
  },
  {
   "id": "h148",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 1</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 1–4</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h149",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Move &amp; Accelerate"
  },
  {
   "id": "h150",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Re-pattern landing, deceleration, balance, and core — then linear and lateral speed mechanics and elastic bounds. Speed and skill build Week 1→3, then Week 4 deloads and you re-check."
  },
  {
   "id": "h151",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 2</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 5–8</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h152",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Power &amp; Compete"
  },
  {
   "id": "h153",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Progress jump amplitude, add capped low-box reactive power and change-of-direction, then competitive application. Volume builds Week 5→7 to a peak, then Week 8 tapers into the final checkpoint."
  },
  {
   "id": "h154",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Block 1 builds the movement and strength base; Block 2 extends the speed and power end — so the whole athlete shifts up and to the right. Volume climbs to a peak, then unloads, so you arrive at each checkpoint sharp, not buried."
  },
  {
   "id": "h155",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 4</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Deload + re-check</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h156",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 8</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Taper + final checkpoint</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h157",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "04 — A Week"
  },
  {
   "id": "h158",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The weekly <em>rhythm.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h159",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Three sessions a week, with a rest day in between. The three days rotate focus so the whole athlete gets built — nothing repeats, nothing gets missed."
  },
  {
   "id": "h160",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "h161",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lower-Body Foundation"
  },
  {
   "id": "h162",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Landing, deceleration, single-leg control, and posterior-chain strength — the durable base under every stride."
  },
  {
   "id": "h163",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h164",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Speed &amp; Core"
  },
  {
   "id": "h165",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Linear sprint mechanics and bracing — turning that base into real, repeatable acceleration."
  },
  {
   "id": "h166",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 3"
  },
  {
   "id": "h167",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lateral Power &amp; Upper"
  },
  {
   "id": "h168",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lateral push, change-of-direction, and push/pull strength — the explosive, two-way hockey athlete."
  },
  {
   "id": "h169",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Rest days sit in between — recovery is where the growth and the gains actually happen."
  },
  {
   "id": "h170",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "05 — Proof"
  },
  {
   "id": "h171",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Progress you can <em>measure.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h172",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Six simple tests — every one gives you a number to beat. Do the same six, in the same order, three times: Week 1, Week 4, and Week 8. No gym needed."
  },
