  {
   "id": "h203",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "06 — Parents"
  },
  {
   "id": "h204",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Loved by hockey <em>families.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h205",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "From parents who wanted real off-ice training for their kids — without the gym, the guesswork, or the boredom."
  },
  {
   "id": "h206",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "His first three strides are genuinely quicker, and his coach said his edges look more controlled. He does it in our garage with a band — no complaints, which at 13 is a miracle."
  },
  {
   "id": "h207",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "M"
  },
  {
   "id": "h208",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Mark T."
  },
  {
   "id": "h209",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey dad · U14"
  },
  {
   "id": "h210",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "I love that it's built for his age, not a copy of an adult program. The deload weeks and the focus on landing mechanics gave me real peace of mind through his growth spurt."
  },
  {
   "id": "h211",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A"
  },
  {
   "id": "h212",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Andrea L."
  },
  {
   "id": "h213",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey mom"
  },
  {
   "id": "h214",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "She's hooked on beating her own test numbers. Broad jump is up, balance is night and day. Worth it for the confidence on the ice alone."
  },
  {
   "id": "h215",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "C"
  },
  {
   "id": "h216",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Chris D."
  },
  {
   "id": "h217",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey dad"
  },
  {
   "id": "h218",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "07 — The Kit"
  },
  {
   "id": "h219",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No gym. <em>No barbells.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h220",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Deliberately minimal, and deliberately light. At this age, bands and bodyweight done with quality are exactly right — a design choice, not a compromise."
  },
  {
   "id": "h221",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Loop resistance bands"
  },
  {
   "id": "h222",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Light dumbbells (optional)"
  },
  {
   "id": "h223",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A low box or bench"
  },
  {
   "id": "h224",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Space to move"
  },
  {
   "id": "h225",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "An open stretch for sprints"
  },
  {
   "id": "h226",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Done at home, in a garage, or at the park. No barbells, no heavy loading, no gym — just quality movement that fits a growing body."
  },
  {
   "id": "h227",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "08 — Growth-Smart"
  },
  {
   "id": "h228",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Built <em>safe.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h229",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<b>Growth comes first.</b> It's built PHV-aware to protect the body through one of its biggest growth windows. We chase quality movement, not big numbers — at this age, that's exactly how athletes get faster and stay healthy."
  },
  {
   "id": "h230",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<b>Peak, then unload.</b> Volume climbs for three weeks, then deliberately backs off. Weeks 4 and 8 deload so your athlete arrives at each checkpoint sharp and fresh — not buried under fatigue."
  },
  {
   "id": "h231",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "09 — Questions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h232",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Good to <em>know.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h233",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Is this safe during the growth spurt?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h234",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Yes — it's designed for it. The program is growth-smart (PHV-aware): bands and bodyweight, no heavy loading, with deload weeks built in to protect a growing body. As with any program, get a quick pre-participation check from your doctor before starting."
  },
  {
   "id": "h235",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Do I need a gym or weights?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h236",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No. Bands and bodyweight (light dumbbells optional) — no barbells, no heavy loading, no gym. It's all doable at home, in a garage, or at the park. The sprint tests just need a longer open stretch like a field."
  },
  {
   "id": "h237",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>How is the program delivered?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h238",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "It's a clean, interactive web program you open on any phone, tablet, or laptop — with a demo video built into every exercise. No PDF to lose, no app to install. Buy once and it's yours forever."
  },
  {
   "id": "h239",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>How much time does each session take?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h240",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "About 45–55 minutes, three times a week. Every session follows the same five-part shape and includes the built-in RAMP warm-up. Run them in order; the plan does the thinking for you."
  },
  {
   "id": "h241",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Will it actually make them faster?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h242",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Realistically: cleaner movement, better balance, harder acceleration, and durable habits — and the six skill-check tests prove it in real numbers. It's not an overnight transformation, and at this age it shouldn't be — chasing big numbers too early is how young athletes get hurt."
  },
  {
   "id": "h243",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Is it too late to start before the season?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h244",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No — and waiting for a \"perfect\" start date is the real mistake. If a full 8 weeks fits before your season, your athlete arrives at day one at their peak. If the season starts sooner, the first weeks of movement, landing, and speed work still show up on the ice within a month — and the program runs fine alongside early-season practices (drop to two sessions in heavy game weeks). Every week you wait is a week of the season played without it."
  },
  {
   "id": "h245",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>What if it's not the right fit?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h246",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "You're covered by a 30-day money-back guarantee. Try it, run the first sessions, and if it isn't right for your athlete, just email us and we'll refund you — no hassle."
  },
  {
   "id": "h247",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<b>Prefer a subscription with a free trial?</b> The Elite Hockey Drills app runs your whole season, personalized to you. First week free on iOS and Android."
